| 工具选择 | `backend/agents/tool_selector.py`、`tool_retriever.py` | `backend/mcps/registry.py` |
| 新增工具 | `backend/mcps/tools/<module>.py` | `backend/mcps/tools/__init__.py`、`src/components/settings/prefs.ts`、`src/lib/rolesStore.ts` |
